---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Antiphon"
  description="Modern European e-invoicing, native to .NET. Antiphon brings e-invoicing functionality directly into your application without external online services or Java sidecars."
>
  <article class="px-6 py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--content-max-width)]">
      <div class="max-w-[var(--reading-max-width)]">
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-[var(--color-action-primary)] uppercase">
          Antiphon
        </p>
        <h1>Modern European e-invoicing, native to .NET.</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
          Antiphon brings European e-invoicing standards directly into the .NET ecosystem,
          integrated into your application rather than dependent on external online services,
          Java sidecars, or other non-native infrastructure.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
          Generate, validate, parse, and work with standards-compliant electronic invoices
          through familiar .NET APIs. Antiphon handles the complexity of the underlying standards
          so your invoicing functionality remains part of your code, your architecture, and your
          infrastructure.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-semibold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
          Your code. Your infrastructure. No sidecars required.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-8 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
          The free browser-based validator is available now. It checks XRechnung, Peppol
          BIS Billing 3.0, Factur-X, and EN 16931 invoice XML against their Schematron
          business rules, entirely in your browser — nothing you paste ever leaves the page.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <Button
            href="https://validator.clockworkotterfoundry.com"
            variant="primary"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Try the free validator
          </Button>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-8 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
          Full SDK details and documentation are still coming soon.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
